Description: pure-Python JSON-RPC 2.0 dispatch core, asyncio server and client
 truenas_pyjsonrpc is a small, fast JSON-RPC 2.0 stack built on msgspec:
 a transport-agnostic dispatch core (truenas_pyjsonrpc), a turnkey asyncio
 AF_UNIX/TCP/WebSocket server (truenas_pyjsonrpc_server), and a thread-safe
 client (truenas_pyjsonrpc_client) with a typed-client generator.
 .
 The optional WebSocket transport requires python3-websockets; AF_UNIX and
 TCP (with optional TLS / kernel-TLS) work with msgspec alone. The opt-in
 batteries-included layer (truenas_pyjsonrpc.mixins) adds protocol mixins for
 PAM/SCRAM authentication and middleware-style syslog auditing; it can use
 python3-truenas-scram for SCRAM (RFC 5802) verification, python3-truenas-pypam
 to relay SCRAM through PAM (pam_truenas), and python3-gssapi for a
 GSSAPI/Kerberos (RFC 4752) mechanism.
